Deployment:
Deployment in Kubernetes is the main reason to auto healing and auto scaling.

For example refer the below Deployment.yml.

by using the replica er can increase the pod.
Replica is nothing but the number of pod should be running as application, even one pod fails the traffic will fall through the other pod.
In meantime replica contoller will automatically create the other pod so that it will match the relica count mentioned in deployment.yml.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: nginx-deployment
  labels:
    app: nginx
spec:
  replicas: 3 ----------------------------------------------here you can see the replica.
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: nginx
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: nginx
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: nginx
        image: nginx:1.14.2
        ports:
        - containerPort: 80
